    "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Follow us on social media for more updates:</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/StrykerEmergencyCare\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">Facebook</span></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/StrykerEC\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">Twitter</span></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/stryker-emergency-care-/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">LinkedIn</span></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/stryker/featured\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">Youtube</span></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Celebrate survivors of sudden cardiac arrest&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/celebrate-survivors.html\" target=\"_self\">Submit your story</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
